    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "d"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "To the chief Musician,",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "A Psalm",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "of David, to bring to remembrance.",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 70:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Make haste",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.70.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.70.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", O God, to deliver me; make haste to help me, O",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.70.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.70.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.70.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.70.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.70.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.70.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 70:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Let them be ashamed and confounded that seek after my soul: let them be turned backward, and put to confusion, that desire my hurt.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.70.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.70.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 70:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Let them be turned back for a reward of their shame that say, Aha, aha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.70.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.70.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 70:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Let all those that seek thee rejoice and be glad in thee: and let such as love thy salvation say continually, Let God be magnified.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.70.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.70.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 70:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But I",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.70.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.70.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "am",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.70.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.70.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "poor and needy: make haste unto me, O God: thou",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.70.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.70.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "art",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.70.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.70.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "my help and my deliverer; O",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.70.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.70.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.70.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.70.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", make no tarrying.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.70.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.70.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
